# SHA-256 of the certificate that signs every released Sombra.app (ADR 0050).
# The release gate (scripts/release/app_gate.py) refuses a final release signed by anything
# else, and macOS keys the users' permission grants on this certificate, so it never
# changes. Create it once with scripts/release/make-signing-identity.sh, then put the
# printed fingerprint on the line below (64 hex characters) through a PR.
61053ed7549338b4bb3b618463389e25df50a904fb2f76d58dc6deed6a2ea3c0
